Root cause:
The bug was caused by the logic in the `ClusterResourceProvider` class that allowed the same configuration type to be added multiple times during the blueprint deployment process. This led to potential inconsistencies and errors in the cluster configuration. The patch introduced a mechanism to track encountered configuration types using a `HashSet`, ensuring that each configuration type is only processed once, thereby preventing duplicate entries.
